====Usage notes====
The term {{term|Srbin|Sȑbin|lang=sh}} denotes an ethnic Serb, while the term {{term|Srbijanac|Srbijánac|lang=sh}} has a complex meaning since it is sometimes considered derogatory, and the terms {{term|Srbin|Sȑbin|lang=sh}} and {{term|Srpkinja|Sȑpkinja|lang=sh}} should be used instead.

